{
  "6": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:cc266faaeaa54d3cb29fd65af13e16177e8e95393800464c89d82d823ececaeb",
      "text": "You've come a bit too early.\nYou've seen something I didn't\nmuch want seen.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "10": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:38b6fba0f8cb75e3fa7b26fb5efd28989e9334396f5fc40156d5a4c8191f2195",
      "text": "...When you say that, it usually\nmeans something good happened.\nI'm getting to know you.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "14": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9f9e080d9e3196ec2d4b8f2f4f11b6d0ad59f56c8a47440b3b24dd2ccdbd1cb0",
      "text": "That was a charity-loving eccentric.\nThey barged in, saying they want to\nbuild a new Float near Kowloon.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "17": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:700b2659fb0ef11f300d7f8e38bfff7434f586a0eb93ce134f6cffaa74a5a1a2",
      "text": "They said they'd build a school. A\nsafety net for Kowloon, and a road\nopen to the Floats beyond.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "20": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:fdad958cd14120144c5ddc98e5d557b69c29dc7500ccf6b03b0563ad9978f808",
      "text": "...A fool, or fearless? Either way,\na strange one.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "25": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2055239a80e25b7d887fd8788a7d36c1a52ce6224e993f86f3f1356b5b312fb0",
      "text": "It's written all over your face how\nhappy you are...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "29": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a1e90f6a43c67e4224b5e7e917a694d13f1ad84a77a529490cdddae498744a66",
      "text": "I see.\nThat's good news, then?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "34": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:49a7216e3086350d2bd27073c9551c4a85eac8aae9db9420e6071ff9e006eed3",
      "text": "Who knows.\n...I only hope it doesn't turn into\ntrouble.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "37": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:aff257605f7d5dac9e9ad5d9019fc85d19b645ab3d5f96ae2f18ce83a7f7e8cf",
      "text": "More to the point, the goods you\nwanted have arrived.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "39": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:92bb1e7ec0606ed73c08863d0bcff795c21f19e161197ef38c6cf78f087436ac",
      "text": "I get wisdom, and you get info on the\nStar Augurs. That was the deal,\nwasn't it?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "42": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:dbbcf0fd1000bcb359dc84c0a9007e199607e21c563ebc5ce81ee2ec8dca66ef",
      "text": "It was a good deal, Starview. I'd be\nglad if we could keep up this\ncooperation.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "46": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:bc1af296b5d59be7f5649e6fc8a2c8a05ac912044fa9d152e5affad93e8f4129",
      "text": "Pardon me...!\nBoss, there's a problem with that\nmatter...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "51": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:56b9994c53a30d424a45d3507a91efdb850f89070123142e3b960fd47b99e90a",
      "text": "Other organizations are meddling with\nthe new Float's construction site?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "55": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1e2ab96cc8e463b736dd29d694b119691520d367b9081e39aea2272de7709894",
      "text": "For now. But it doesn't seem like\nthey merely caught a whiff of money.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "60": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:56639d59fd3617fd79e9e943c495cd9bed31168668dd150fb52c5013e63d0000",
      "text": "Weapons have started arriving. And\nsoldiers are being gathered from\noutside groups.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "64": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:290d9995886b7aab1de4b6f03b7831e65e8a9d1a7cc4a16eb52b2747b4e7705f",
      "text": "...Nobody knows you're involved,\ncorrect?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "68": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8e373c2dab853d1f0d570a709e299b19dd66d0339a9a6c6f59abd7501acd94e1",
      "text": "Yes. The new Float is backed by\noutside capital and philanthropists.\nThe Tsangli have no hand in it.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "71": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3b3e42ec295b2d3f3cd9f1edadd639c7d3be6bbd3a56362e34ec681ab6e6916f",
      "text": "...That's the story, anyway. Besides,\nit's outside our territory, within\nthe Gaean government's sight.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "72": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9b3773fc90c8ee18b5a2360c75f143cfa142d3b034448f2ecde18df9e3af321c",
      "text": "The mafia shouldn't be able to move\nopenly there. Something is wrong...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "76": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:296c63b40386227e1a137698ee5f14d4646f792735343b9328f1caba6bd3809b",
      "text": "...Perhaps they've sniffed out your\nties to us.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "80": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ae9dfc98b05a51f077d138fb3ed02eae347b790ecb46eacbaa45e32d48cfcc2e",
      "text": "Your outfit grew big through gang\nwars, right? ...So you've got no\nshortage of enemies.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "82": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8b64ffca808e10c9f1e785f8cc00b9b33dd596da7b53dd944d2dd788de1eaf6c",
      "text": "Either the Gaean government's in on\nit, or someone's lost it and doesn't\ncare anymore. That's the nasty kind.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "85": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7ae47417030a29628680564100ecd4e887499a34fba286c3c26d24f01d4b5c3c",
      "text": "I can't make a move.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "88": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:733d12f726cb0d42c062177ef304a9dc87693d18ae8e03d87f3ba1e6c12f733c",
      "text": "If I act here, my ties to the Tsangli\nwill become plain.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "89": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6a8a5b9b6969871653b8d8881d7d6ac3cceca7700ee47c0090d8144ddcb723c1",
      "text": "And even if I won that fight, the\nfloat would fall into the Tsangli's\nhands, into the mafia's grasp.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "93": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:93f33792f2f4d7de3b90d2f18daff29691a96f6b6da38f256cffeebaf4b95719",
      "text": "That would be meaningless...\nIt wouldn't open up our future...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "99": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:fc31629da6f64d91e1aef3c949743339e8bcad39e501b70cb87ad75ca67094fa",
      "text": "...Your debts caught up with you.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "103": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:31820f240432638b7f9248307559024f58ec00a2bd9bcd5e9d2b61762454cae3",
      "text": "There must be something I can do...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "106": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:04cc38ccbe26641f6aeb15c5016b63255937cb48a7f7b18d4af24c5f0cd0810f",
      "text": "...But how?\nHow could I—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "111": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f61e2d5aefe04b82f084d91efbee06725cbc798bee9282473447895845463626",
      "text": "We get info, you give us wisdom.\nWasn't that the deal?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "115": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ab173c945ea6ea0e8859e347fc0483362f213207ba151fc2a673d73329a81145",
      "text": "Did you forget what you just said\nyourself?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "119": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b2af1d0892ed7c8cd48ee55ee9d751d9691485a8e3c59eadb0b8f5b3f5c4693d",
      "text": "You'd... help me...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "125": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:aaf9c99774198b9a5ee5156007d007dada216126bc30e97a9e0b22c5017dd135",
      "text": "If that's what you wish.\nLanmei.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "131": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:39ff0a9c10792e211ad0a32ee36bc2af71f04cc8ecbaa1e901e8f3e632e88e40",
      "text": "Ngh—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "136": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a1465448a21d7c3ec57a2c0b6bf05b3a35dbeca9a0b93d86c5aa3e77263c6214",
      "text": "Then let's do this like pirates.\n...Though we'll need to put on a bit\nof a show.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "140": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a17e9b2f85ea157786d87bc4b2f685d5b3446b21fee3fa5d6b675d66fcf4431f",
      "text": "Hahaha! Fools! You've handed us a\nreason to invade! I'm so grateful\nI could cry!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "143": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:598a6da2cf2e5608f28c9fb960ffb79b43f99ef401cffd8bebf8bc4917b2b5e7",
      "text": "...You seem to be having fun.\nEsmeralda?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "146": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:97df510122914afbca1c53a3201f19e6cbfdd104f7ba96bb2271e28e8270a953",
      "text": "Hmph. Those Kowloon brats gave me\nplenty of trouble when I set up\nthe Bellaqua Casino.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "147": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0ffd08d9e5c6f0bb7f79e15cdf3b90db310bd09bbcc4bde58acef78fc67a4cc5",
      "text": "I think I'm entitled to a little\npayback, don't you?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "151": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:aa9b279cae748dcbfc9088307d859a3c00af0eff3ceacbee03e1d7658429eb1c",
      "text": "The interior has been secured.\nOnly one enemy ship remains.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "154": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:886c3506a88f4e600df27c60dc376e3fa2b9a450ab36a6be6bd6546926fc5b9c",
      "text": "It's a Tsangli ship.\nBeware of cannon fire.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "158": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f2ad15463c2ef562d507d6f2bd347e77af787325e98521fb08fd7de8e0fcbfbc",
      "text": "So they say, Mermaid Pirates.\nCan you handle it?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "162": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d0cf3a290f04fef0446bce1658f557c6b3b81c30cab3f53507574e7e7a52a924",
      "text": "Of course! Easy peasy.\nWe can sink the ship, right?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "166": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3da143d8fdd4f9370fbcfcd7999f2b9bcf561ede61601e6c0af49a7367937803",
      "text": "You don't plan to kill anyone anyway.\nDo as you like.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "172": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d8dec350b63d960ca392b0bbd6151d829cc979fe0992c4cafe5c27ccdea2b87f",
      "text": "Roger!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "177": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c8cb57e373a8d20a9868b5237467d03d803dcc333a5d99b8e3b21aeb23a1647c",
      "text": "So there you have it, gentlemen of\nthe mafia. From now on, the Mermaid\nPirates will run that new Float.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "179": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c9f3b12870fc0aacfd54d1e13580c4975be126106550b54f0ce6b0152f587f27",
      "text": "We don't intend to trespass on\nKowloon's territory. We'd rather\ntalk business, if that's all right?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "186": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1521cad76321461d2c39f0dd0cf63fe0f86119e88aeb5184e3873ca7e2034760",
      "text": "Heh... hehehe.\nAhahahaha...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "190": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9f71fb8c817e6df7d7e73346e83634a7159c54f6cc2b6e69aa80152831b79d10",
      "text": "A complete defeat...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "197": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:271c90dbf3c88b0284fa843fcbb935464c7bde1606f533cd1e77092e094c79b6",
      "text": "Neither the mafia nor those behind\nthem knew it, but the new Float had\nsolid backing.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "199": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9088ae928d1cb0a1b96c14863abdde437a54ea58e98dac7738e25deb3468ab12",
      "text": "Esmeralda, casino owner of Paradise\nIsle, and Pern of Miner's Front.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "202": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b5f46b0be60701cc9cb58328eafb2fd52f5bc4a245a29da250a2502aa38c1290",
      "text": "And the Mermaid Pirates, who style\nthemselves heirs of the Vermillion\nBlade. That's how we arranged it.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "206": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8075e4efce22339c10a22ac5c3c78480afe86b7b57f37903ea8121da8d62e232",
      "text": "...The steel wolf moved first,\ndidn't he? You've outdone me.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "211": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3a3c3d0aff5b81562efc1c501248b202570bc8ce44539b3552bd34149ff2ccbd",
      "text": "The Tsangli helped our fellows but\nlost three ships. Our reputation is\nin tatters.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "215": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ad280c6732abcdaf1d455fa30658c9467665c3dffc29e0bf4abe5de65e7b8370",
      "text": "Still, I didn't expect the crushed\nmafia's members to switch over to\nbeing Miner's Front laborers.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "219": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2e7099ec8eefc721944123f10987db985b465d79d5a35186bb45930d7b730506",
      "text": "The outlaws of this town were drifters\nwho lost their places to begin with.\nGive them a place that values them.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "222": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:260b8201a22049d095467f927526be9c6ea82704ca8bb23c3a62e9727ba09ce0",
      "text": "...Let me thank you again.\nThank you for helping me.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "227": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:526b74c30ea93c455a38daddef2e296d5543591785c6f82f586aaf562308be68",
      "text": "So? What are you gonna do now?\nYou're still going to keep at\nthat, huh?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "231": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:27932cb215eccf3809483af650b503d66725a6498d319e54ee1bb8edcd899c13",
      "text": "Of course I will.\n...Why wouldn't I?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "235": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:eb0573a76a957e2fdcbe2eeb7ee873eecd7fa1ac4360783f83adfa169115153f",
      "text": "I have allies now.\nThis time, I'll do even better.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "240": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:919b1cdc80b9d7d76d447f641d62d0975e7ef7a8aac3b105c05740caf4ebbb8e",
      "text": "Geez. Some people never learn...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  }
}
